# Physics stage 8, step 4c: what blood decals cost. 256 stains (the limit) on a 20 m grid round the hero
# on Onar's field, the camera high behind him so most are in view; 30 s of normal app cadence without
# video. Run with BLOOD=1 and BLOOD=0 (the same scene without decals); the target is p95 frame +0.2 ms.
# OPENGOTHIC_GPU_PASSES=1 on a frame-profile build gives the "Blood decals" pass alone.
seed 73015
cheat god
set time 12 0
release all
overlay off
view full
goto NW_BIGFARM_VORPOSTEN1_01_RIGHTFIELD_02
wait 500
clear 3000
blood_stains fill 256 125
blood_stains advance 10
cam follow 700 650 180
wait 3000
shot cost-view
wait 500
cadence normal
wait 34
cadence wait
quit
